    "Hold the roster key for the crew's names, and who's speaking.",
    "Most things that kill you hold you first. Your crew has a few seconds.",
    "A long train is slow to stop. Read the boards ahead.",
    "The night goes on behind the menu. Nobody waits for you.",
    "Bodies come home for most of what they cost.",
    "The fire wants feeding, and the pressure gauge says how hungry it is.",
    "Your hands say what they can do in the corner of the screen.",
    "The dead watch through their crew's eyes, and talk among themselves."
